      "message": "The error likely comes from the \"output\" part for the same reason I have explained in the `OutputDoesNotBlockWhenNoInput` test. Since `sendBurstCommands` joins the worker thread before returning, the writing part will never observe the reading, and thus its presentation counter will remain at zero.",
